   794	def find_report(root, head):
   795	    """Locate the report that governs HEAD.
   796	
   797	    Returns (report, reason, malformed):
   798	      * exact HEAD report when present;
   799	      * else a report bound to a first-parent ancestor, accepted ONLY if the
   800	        diff ancestor..HEAD touches nothing but evidence files (this is what
   801	        makes "attest, commit the report, gate in CI" possible);
   802	      * (None, why, True) when a report file exists but is corrupt, forged,
   803	        or SHA-mismatched — malformed evidence fails EVERY tier;
   804	      * (None, why, False) when no usable report exists.
