  1542	    could set it. Real transcript evidence must:
  1543	      * name the transcript EXACTLY `.coverloop/reports/<commit>.<name>.log`
  1544	        (no traversal, and no REPLAY of an old/unrelated log under a different
  1545	        commit or reviewer);
