  1555	    # error log, not a review — accepting it would let a failed run pass
  1556	    # --require-captured. Attached transcripts carry no exit code (the tool
  1557	    # executed nothing); their trust rests on the committed, hash-bound,
  1558	    # human-readable log alone.
